          "kicker": "Coaching outlook",
          "heading": "Jake White tips Fiji as a 'massive force' for 2027 World Cup",
          "body": "Jake White is already talking up Fiji's World Cup chances. After the 34-28 win over Japan in Tokyo, he said that if he can get \"the best 33 players together\" for the 2027 tournament in Australia, Fiji \"can be a massive force\". White named no Europe-based players for that game and handed out four new caps, and his overseas contingent will be available for the France, Ireland and Italy tests."
