      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Injury blow",
          "heading": "Fin Smith withdrawn with calf injury as Charlie Atkinson joins England squad",
          "body": "England's fly-half problem arrives ahead of the Nations Championship opener against Australia. Fin Smith, who started at 10 in all three July Tests, has damaged a calf and pulled out of the 36-man training squad, with Gloucester's Charlie Atkinson drafted in as cover. Borthwick also has Marcus Smith and George Ford as specialist 10s, but England's management say they remain hopeful Smith will be back in time, and an official update is due on Tuesday."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
          "heading": "South Africa's Cheslin Kolbe out of Nations Championship with broken jaw",
          "body": "Argentina's Santiago Carreras faces scan on serious lower-limb injury. Italy's Tommaso Menoncello likely out of autumn Tests with shoulder sprain."
