    "389": {
      "date": "2026-10-27",
      "edition": "Tuesday 27 October",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Injury blow",
          "heading": "Tommaso Menoncello suffers shoulder sprain, likely to miss autumn Tests",
          "body": "Menoncello went off in the 43rd minute of Toulouse's 43-40 Champions Cup win over Exeter Chiefs with a sprained left shoulder, expected to keep him out for several weeks and likely to rule him out of Italy's autumn Tests. It is another setback for the 24-year-old, who earlier this season was also hurt against La Rochelle. Gonzalo Quesada must now plan for South Africa, Argentina and Fiji without him."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
