          "kicker": "Squad selection",
          "heading": "Ollie Leatherbarrow, uncapped Newcastle back-rower, named in Townsend's 37-man squad",
          "body": "Ollie Leatherbarrow is the only uncapped name in Gregor Townsend's 37-man squad for the November Nations Championship Tests, the Newcastle Red Bulls back-rower having qualified through his grandmother from Perth. The 24-year-old, who has 11 Scotland U20 caps, is the most notable inclusion in an otherwise familiar group. Jamie Ritchie, Darcy Graham and Duhan van der Merwe are back after injury, and Huw Jones returns after missing the July tour. Grant Gilchrist is absent, and Hector Patterson has missed out."
        },
