          "kicker": "Availability row",
          "heading": "Steve Tandy's camp takes 24 Welsh players out of URC round five",
          "body": "Steve Tandy's Test camp has pulled 24 Welsh players out of round five of the URC, with the regional internationals assembling at their Welsh base before the opening Test against Japan. Cardiff are missing seven, the Scarlets seven, the Dragons six and the Ospreys four, and RUCK says the situation is a nightmare for the head coach. Looking back at the summer squad, 14 of his 46-player extended group who play outside Wales were unavailable, a familiar frustration that is simmering again."
        },
        {
