          "kicker": "Injury blow",
          "heading": "Felipe Contepomi loses Santiago Carreras and Thomas Gallo to injury before Ireland",
          "body": "Argentina go into the Ireland opener without two key men. Santiago Carreras, who has 70 Test caps, limped off on crutches in the 13th minute of Bath's 23-5 defeat to Gloucester and faces a scan on what appears to be a serious lower-limb injury. Thomas Gallo is out for at least six months after wrist surgery, while Santiago Chocobares awaits an HIA outcome, with Matías Moroni on standby."
        },
