          "heading": "Fin Smith's calf injury puts England's fly-half in doubt for Wallabies",
          "body": "Fin Smith's fitness is the question hanging over England ahead of their Nations Championship clash with Australia. The 24-year-old damaged a calf against Leicester on Saturday and will miss England's three-day camp this week, though England remain hopeful he will be back in time. Borthwick has called up Gloucester's Charlie Atkinson as cover, and an official update is due Tuesday. Smith started all three of England's July Tests at 10."
